Description:
In August of 2023, TechPats joined J.S. Held to create the firm’s Intellectual Property Specialty Services group under its Ocean Tomo brand. 

---

Ocean Tomo provides Expert Opinion, Management Consulting, Advisory, and Specialty Services focused on matters involving intellectual property (IP) and other intangible assets. Practice offerings address economic damage calculations and testimony; business licensing strategy and contract interpretation; patent-focused business intelligence; portfolio development strategy; litigation support; trade secret reasonable measures; asset and business valuation; strategy and risk management consulting; merger and acquisition advisory; debt and equity private placement; and IP brokerage.  Subsidiaries of Ocean Tomo include Ocean Tomo Investments Group, LLC, a registered broker-dealer.

As a part of J.S. Held, Ocean Tomo works alongside more than 1500 professionals globally and assists clients – corporations, insurers, law firms, governments, and institutional investors – on complex technical, scientific, and financial matters across all assets and value at risk.

Specialty Services includes:

Patent-Focused Business Intelligence, including patent infringement analysis, laboratory testing, reverse engineering, tear-down services, patent mining, market analysis, and portfolio assessment; 

Portfolio Development Strategy, including competitive technology patent landscapes, patent mining and evaluation, portfolio assessment and cost analysis, and strategic patenting advisory services;

Litigation Support, including assessments related to litigation risk, validity analysis, PTAB & IPR support, and claim chart analysis; 

Transaction & Monetization Strategy, including IP acquisition due diligence as well as buy versus build versus abandonment decisions.  

Learn more about IP Specialty Services at, www.oceantomo.com/services/specialty-services.

The ARMA-NCR (Ottawa) Chapter serves more than 200 members and a wide range of associates in the field of information and records management, including records managers, librarians, archivists, information technology specialists, and stakeholders from every field of undertaking. ARMA-NCR is an active and exciting ARMA Canada Chapter that seeks to:

- Advance the practice of Records and Information Management as a discipline and a profession; 
- Organize and promote programs of research, education, training and networking within the profession;
- Support the enhancement of professionalism among the membership; and
- Promote co-operative endeavours with related professional groups.

The Work Room is a one-stop career and employment centre for everyone in the community. Our goal is to empower you to make informed career decisions and reach your career goals.  

The Work Room can help with: 

Workshops & Presentations;  
Job Search Assistance;  
Résumé Services; 
Interview Preparation; 
Career Planning Tools;
Labour Market Information  

We have 8 locations throughout Southwest NB! All services are free of charge, and we provide many options to access our services: in-person, virtual, email, and telephone.  

The Work Room is made possible through a partnership between the Department of Post-Secondary Education, Training, and Labour & the Anglophone South School District.

Notre vision
Créateur de succès et du rayonnement entrepreneurial.

Notre mission
Accroître la vitalité économique et l'attractivité de La Matanie en créant des alliances stratégiques avec nos partenaires et en accompagnant, avec agilité, les entrepreneur.es.

Axes prioritaires
- Développement économique
- Développement touristique
- Marketing territorial (attractivité et rétention, recrutement de la main d'œuvre)

Services offerts
- Accompagnement, conseils et outils dans les différentes étapes de développement de l'entreprise;
- Soutien au travail autonome (STA);
- Développement de l'entrepreneuriat;
- Démarchage et prospection de nouveaux projets et de nouvelles entreprises;
- Recherche de financement;
- Organisation et support à la formation des entrepreneurs;
- Financement offert par le biais des Fonds d'investissements (FLI, FLS) et des programmes d'aide aux entreprises;
- Support au transfert d'entreprises et mentorat;
- Démarchage et support à l'organisation d'événements et de congrès d'affaires;
- Veille stratégique et diffusion de l'information.

Une équipe au service des entrepreneurs!

We are looking for export ready innovations

A) Participation Criteria

1. You have innovated in recent years whether
- New products;
- New services;
- New processes;
- New applications;
- New distribution system.

2. Your innovation has proven success on local market for at least one year and is ready to address your targeted markets

3. You are interested to open new markets in one of the following regions or countries;
- One of the six regions of Canada
- One of the 10 regions of the United States
- South America, Europe, Africa, Asia, Oceania

B) Services
1. Free:
- We share your business needs anonymously to our network including Marketing/Sales Professionals, Economic Development and Industrial Specialists within our networks.
- We report interest and possibilities.

2. Value Added Services
- Recruiting a team of professionals addressing your project in one of the 54 countries;
- Selecting a specialist acting as lead manager on a specific target market;
- Identification of prospects from a chosen or given contact list;
- Conversion of prospects into marketing leads;
- Conversion of sales leads into qualifiable sales leads;
- Support to sales leads qualification and follow up;
- Assigning by 4 professionals to your export project;
- Upload and categorization of of documents and templates guiding professionals though your plan;
- Multi-city workflow and communications monitoring  (emails, tasks, events, telephones, publications);
- Access to data in real time in the back office;
- Access to data in real time through mobile application.

3. Reports 
- Dashboard for 
- Annual reports

C) Additional options available from our members
- Community/City economic development;
- Marketing/Export Strategic Counseling on export markets;
- Face to face, warm introductions on target markets;
- Mass marketing/sales campaign;
- Consulting Services to increase competitiveness.

We offer access to: 
(1) A document library filled with templates and sample contracts;
(2) Local professionals willing to provide free half-hour consults and discounts from their hourly rates, including lawyers, accountants, and other service providers;
(3) Flat-rate services covering various needs, such as legal, finance, design, and translations, to name only a few; 
(4) Turul-supported products and services made available at discounted rates; and
(5) Free resources from Turul Network and various 3rd-parties;

How can small business owners like you compete with larger companies? By collaborating!

Wayfinders is building a business community of trust and a suite of online services to help you succeed in your business ventures.

Wayfinders is helping entrepreneurs find their way going forward. We can help you to surround yourself with appropriate talent and tools to generate your best value for members and customers:

1) improve results by focusing on applying your own greatest talents while leveraging additional resources as needed;
2) find people and create a team you can rely on as well as loyal customers;
3) choose the right online tools for the work you do, such as productivity and collaboration tools;
4) leverage external resources by joining and contributing to supply nets, industry clusters and the local business ecosystem

We do this through business socials, mastermind groups, and access to resources and training offered exclusively to our members.

Espace entrepreneuriat collectif de l’Abitibi-Témiscamingue est un OBNL qui a pour mission de promouvoir l’entrepreneuriat collectif sociale sur l’ensemble du territoire. En favorisant la concertation et le partenariat entre les acteurs locaux, régionaux et nationaux en économie sociale, et ce, afin d’harmoniser les interventions et d’en maximiser les effets.
Nos Objectifs :
  •	Soutenir le développement des entreprises collectives d’économie sociale et les compétences des dirigeants;
  •	Contribuer à la notoriété de l'économie sociale et à l'appropriation de ses principes;
  •	Contribuer à positionner l'économie sociale comme modèle entrepreneurial possible, pertinent et viable dans l'économie régionale (au démarrage et pendant la vie de l'entreprise d'économie sociale);
   •	S'inscrire en complémentarité des actions inscrites au PAGES et venir en appui aux ministères chargés de la réalisation des actions;
   •	Se doter d'une structure organisationnelle et financière solide permettant de faire face aux enjeux de la planification stratégique quinquennale.

StartupNow helps entrepreneurs to quickly start a successful business.

We help people to:

• Quit a boring job and improve their lifestyle by owning their own business;
• Feel accomplished and work in a business that fulfills their passion;
• Gain freedom, work from home, manage time, mix family and career, travel;
• Achieve financial independence;
• Lower the risks of failure associated with starting a business;
• Simplyfly the process of starting a business from A to Z;
• Make sure they plan all aspects of their business to maximize their chance of success;

StartupNow founder, Bruno Goulet, helps you start a successful business quickly with a Step-by-Step Business Startup Program that has been developper by entrepreneurs for entrepreneurs. This business startup blueprint also includes MBA grade management concepts that are critical to building a longterm business success.

Visit StartupNow.com to get your free 1st Video Coaching Session.

subteni.com facilite la relation entre les professionnels de services et leurs clients.

Les professionnels ont accès aux fonctionnalités suivantes : 
 - l'inscription ;
 - la gestion des succursales et des services offerts ;
 - la gestion des demandes de service, incluant la négociation avec les clients (acceptation, refus, demande de modification, annulation) ;
 - la consultation des évaluations faites par les clients ;
 - la définition de leur disponibilité (horaires et rendez-vous disponibles).

Les consommateurs de services profitent gratuitement des fonctionnalités suivantes : 
 - la recherche de professionnels avec visualisation des évaluations ;
 - l'inscription (complète ou partielle) ;
 - l'envoi de demandes de service ;
 - la gestion des demandes de service (modification, annulation, acceptation ou refus des modifications proposées par le professionnel) ; 
 - l'évaluation des services reçus.

Subteni est complètement gratuit pour les consommateurs de services. Des frais s'appliquent aux professionnels pour les services demandés par ses clients; c'est-à-dire, aucuns frais fixes.

PROMOTING ACCESS TO HEALTH AND SOCIAL SERVICES in English in the Montérégie, the Assistance and Referral Center Health and Social Services (ARC) is a not-for-profit, non-partisan community organization that envisions vibrant and thriving communities in the Montérégie.  As part of a province-wide network, ARC:

► contributes, connects, and shares resources and information that promotes access to health and social services 
      in English; 
► collaborates on community-wide initiatives; 
► develops community awareness of the need for services in English; 
► supports recruiting and retention efforts so that there are more English-speaking health professionals working in 
      our health and social services system.

PROMOUVOIR L'ACCÈS AUX SERVICES DE SANTÉ ET AUX SERVICES SOCIAUX en anglais en Montérégie, le Centre d'assistance et de référence en santé et services sociaux (ARC) est un organisme communautaire sans but lucratif et non partisan qui envisage des communautés dynamiques et florissantes en Montérégie. Dans le cadre d'un réseau provincial, ARC:

► contribue, relie et partage des ressources et de l'information qui favorisent l'accès aux services de santé et aux 
      services sociaux  en anglais;
► collabore à des initiatives à l'échelle de la communauté;
► sensibilise la communauté au besoin de services en anglais;
► soutient les efforts de recrutement et de rétention afin qu'il y ait plus de professionnels de la santé anglophones 
      qui travaillent notre système de santé et de services sociaux


